- Update to version 1.4.2+git20260608115330:
  * 106 changes in total
  * Includes support for several new SoCs: Allwinner A63 / A80 /
    A83T / A100 / A133 / A523 / F1C100s / H6 / H616 / H626 / R40 /
    R329 / R528 / T7 / T113 / V3s / V5 / V536 / V831 / V853
  * bare-metal: Add JTAG pin muxing support
  * fel: Introduce 'sid-dump'
  * fel: Add FIT image parsing and loading
- Add tests

